ezmonitor (0.1.2-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fixed Plasmoid.icon being hardcoded to "weather-clear-symbolic",
    silently overriding the real app icon added in 0.1.1.
  * XHR callback now checks readyState/status and shows an error label
    instead of silently displaying stale data when unreachable.

 -- Agundur <info@agundur.de>  Wed, 08 Jul 2026 16:00:00 +0200

ezmonitor (0.1.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First automated .deb/.plasmoid/RPM release via GitHub Actions.
  * Fixed License metadata (was "GPL", LICENSE file was even the wrong
    license text entirely — LGPL addendum instead of GPL-3.0-or-later).
  * Added a real app icon from the repo's own unused sun-fill.svg (was
    borrowing the unrelated "electron" icon).
  * CMakeLists.txt no longer requires a C++ toolchain (pure QML plasmoid).

 -- Agundur <info@agundur.de>  Wed, 08 Jul 2026 12:00:00 +0200
